  unitName: Third Eye Diastima
  unitId: 51107
  unitNumber: 1522
  description: Recent discoveries have revealed that Diastima was a member of an
    otherworldly race known as the Bright Eyes. Supposedly, the Bright Eyes have
    a third eye known as the True Light Eye which opens upon reaching adulthood.
    This transformation also grants them their true power. Diastima never reached
    adulthood in Elgaia, but might have gained immeasurable power had it come to
    pass. Furthermore, no other member of Diastima's race has ever been found in
    either Grand Gaia or Elgaia to this day.
